@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #2F3A4A
}
left to right direction

title Diagram 1 - Context Model (System Boundary)

actor Member as member
actor Staff as staff
actor Admin as admin
cloud "Email Service\n(SMTP)" as email

rectangle "Badminton Activity Management System" as sys {
  rectangle "Client Front-end\n(Vue)" as client
  rectangle "Admin Front-end\n(Vue)" as adminfe
  rectangle "Python Backend\n(FastAPI)" as backend
  database "MySQL Database" as db
}

member --> client : register/login\nfind account\nreset password\njoin activities
staff --> client : scan sign code\nstart/stop sign
admin --> adminfe : review users\nmanage activities

client --> backend : REST API calls
adminfe --> backend : REST API calls
backend --> db : SQL query/transaction
backend --> email : send reset email

note bottom of backend
Main entry: python/app/main.py
Routers: python/app/api/*.py
end note

note bottom of db
Schema: database/install.sql
Core tables: users, actions,
records, waiting, verifycode
end note

@enduml
